# Vendored third-party files must survive round-tripping through git
# byte-for-byte, or the SHA-256 hashes recorded in static/vendor/VENDOR.md stop
# verifying. leaflet.css ships with CRLF endings, which git would otherwise
# normalise to LF on commit - silently changing the file the hash describes.
# Disable all line-ending normalisation for them.
static/vendor/** -text
